    {
      "id": "person:speaker-02",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Renee Montagne-Park"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:7455d23b21876103",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 319,
        "char_start": 203,
        "episode_id": "15a1cbea-1449-50ac-bb1c-11784d7421c3",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Thanks, A. correspondent. Excited for this one \u2014 public-radio reporting is something I've been thinking about a lot.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 12000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 6000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:speaker-01",
      "properties": {
        "name": "A. correspondent"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:366bf0cd6eea2ea3",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 499,
        "char_start": 338,
        "episode_id": "15a1cbea-1449-50ac-bb1c-11784d7421c3",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "This episode is brought to you by Squarespace. Squarespace makes building a beautiful, branded website actually pleasant. Get started at squarespace.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:5ff1ae8109e4860a",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 592,
        "char_start": 499,
        "episode_id": "15a1cbea-1449-50ac-bb1c-11784d7421c3",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "I want to dig into that. What's something you used to believe about this that you've revised?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:8b430fb3131e50e8",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 789,
        "char_start": 614,
        "episode_id": "15a1cbea-1449-50ac-bb1c-11784d7421c3",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 Public radio voice is a deliberate style, not an accident. We've seen this play out at teams using BBC. I've watched this pattern hold across three different teams.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:d30c5652a08b5158",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 873,
        "char_start": 808,
        "episode_id": "15a1cbea-1449-50ac-bb1c-11784d7421c3",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Take me through the decision. How does NPR fit into this picture?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:b098c01b84e7606b",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1049,
        "char_start": 895,
        "episode_id": "15a1cbea-1449-50ac-bb1c-11784d7421c3",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Here's how I think about it. Reliability of pronunciation matters more than people think. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e01.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
  ],
